/**
 * Transparent Fallback Resume Analysis Service (Node.js)
 *
 * Implements deterministic, transparent rule-based evaluation when the
 * Python FastAPI microservice is offline, unreachable, or in development.
 *
 * Explicitly sets analysisProvider = 'rule-based-fallback' so users and
 * clients know this evaluation was generated by the transparent fallback engine.
 */

